tion beginning 'llustration' in the paper itself, verified in its HTML — the taxonomy's central figure missing its first letter. Author check #57 found no evidence: the paper read entire and scanned — no phext term of any kind — its references read with it, the built tracker scanned for all ten names, the archive searched entire, the web searched twice, no tie anywhere; all ten authors are new to the book as ingested authors, each carrying True +1 and Unknown +16 from this filing, and the researchers count rises to 240. Two collisions the check exists to keep: the book's Wei Zhang is Paper 042's, standing with the LoopCoder-v2 byline at other institutions — the survey's Wei Zhang, at the Eastern Institute of Technology, is a different person; and the book's Shen is Zhenyi Shen of CODI, not the survey's Xiaoyu Shen — both recorded apart at 67.1.6. Registry after: 1,592 entries — True 566 (446 by stipulation, 120 by verification), Unknown 1,017 (914 attributed, 60 synthesis, 41 open, 2 by estimate), False 2, Fiction 7 — 670 canonical concepts, and the Oracle ledger holds at ~75% (68-82): TRUE exercised and met, UNKNOWN exercised and met, FALSE not exercised, FICTION untouched. The registry-proof step closed clean: the TLUF solver printing ACCURATE on check and ACCURATE on preserve, 22 additions, no transitions, 1,570 unchanged, assumptions: none. The phextura shadow absorbed the filing natively (base sync clean; 22 inserts, 14 replaces, no removes; every comparable scroll identical to the direct conversion; NI from the transaction log equal to the canonical 12/670; validate.py GREEN entire, run against this pass's own conversion report) and stands advanced. The drawing paragraph and the chapter heading were each grepped in the built phext, exactly once each. Two facts of this pass belong to its own history. First, the walk has now filed the map its second leg was already using: Chapter 56 cited this survey before the book held it, and the filing re-reads the walk's or