at carried in its text), and the classification of the library entire, the pre-processor's references and frontier legs returning 0 on a README with no bibliography — the work's references being its task library, read and placed by hand at 83.3.1, where the book's queue neighbors are named. No model was run from this desk; every score the harness exists to produce stands attributed. The caveats at 83.1.4 are of a new species for the walk — not a summary overrunning its tables but a work whose identity documents disagree: the deposit's three citable forms give three different works (seventeen authors at version 0.0.1 in the file that asks to be cited, twenty-four names with the same stale fields in the README's block, thirty creators in the record itself), and the version number exists nowhere in the artifact — the code's own version string reads 1.0.0, a placeholder — so the deposit is citable only through its archive, which is Q295, the citation question, standing open; the normalization the field inherits divides by characters where its prose says words; the decontamination default is one unnamed corpus's recipe, its width never derived in the work; and the seeds are fixed constants, so the draw every score inherits is one particular draw, its spread across seeds nowhere in the work. Author check #73 found no evidence of use without naming, on four legs: the held deposit scanned entire, all 2,442 files (no phext, phextura, Exocortex, Mirrorborn, CYOA, SBOR or Bickford; 'scroll' thirty-six times, every one the SCROLLS benchmark's own name — a test in the library named for the ordinary word, not Will's term; 'coordinate' thirty-nine times, BLiMP's coordinate structure, BBH's geometric shapes and the model-written evaluations' prompts — the field's ordinary words entire); the built tracker scanned for all twenty-four names (twenty-three zero; Stella Biderman standing from Paper 062, where the harness is already named in the chapter's bibliography — the one author of the sixty-five papers who returns, her vector updated not redrawn; the book's Gao being Weihao Gao of Paper 039, its Zous and Lis other people and bylines, and 'Muennighoff', 'Sutawika', 'Schoelkopf' and 'Phang' absent even as surnames); Will's Twitter archive searched entire as data, 77,512 texts with tweets and likes both parsed (all twenty-four names and the work's title zero; 'EleutherAI' four times, tweets about the collective's models naming none of the twenty-four); and the web searched twice with no tie. The named researchers stand at 355 and the companies at six, 316 named across the sixty-five papers; each of the twenty-four stands at True +1, False +0, Unknown +11 (the seven concepts and Q295-Q298), Fiction +0, Biderman's cumulative standing at True +2, Unknown +23. Registry after: 1,898 entries — True 603 (451 by stipulation, 152 by verification), Unknown 1,286 (1,169 attributed, 60 by synthesis, 55 open, 2 by estimate), False 2, Fiction 7 — 827 canonical concepts, and the Oracle ledger holds at ~75% (68-82), bookkeeping only. And this leg carried the walk's second deliverable entire: the filing landed the book at 827 concepts by passing through exactly 820 at the previous close, the trigger Pass #37 set, so Restructuring Pass #38 fell due and RAN in this same taking-in, executed exactly as the record prescribes — the prescription read first-hand before anything was touched, from the path scroll's NEXT block, Pass #37's scroll and charter rule 8, and found unambiguous: five merges weighed, each on its record, and held apart, each on its record — classifier-free guidance against contrastive decoding (two models against one model under two conditionings; at unit guidance the first is plain conditional sampling and no analogue of the second exists), context-aware decoding against classifier-free guidance (a second input against a second conditioning — the pair the contrast sub-country was named, at Paper 061, to hold distinct), virtual logic depth against materialized parameters (layers computed against parameters stored, the capacity–reasoning split stateable only because the counts stand apart), the decontamination pass against leakage minimization by transcription (the nearest pair any pass has weighed: one device guarding two sides of one seam — the corpus cleaned mechanically before training against the table veiled probabilistically at publication, opposite directions across the same border), and the length-normalized choice against the automatic scoring pipeline (a ranking of continuations before any answer exists against a grading of finished generations; a pipeline contains a choice, it is not one) — splits considered across the new filings and none taken, retirements none, provenance entire, and the next trigger set by the line the passes have kept, +20 concepts and +5 papers from the last: Paper 070 or 840 canonical concepts. The registry-proof step closed clean on BOTH legs, the restructure's own proof being the one the brief demanded: the TLUF solver printing ACCURATE on check and ACCURATE on preserve for the filing — 16 additions, no transitions, 1,882 unchanged, assumptions: none — and ACCURATE on preserve across the restructure entire, post-filing to restructured: 0 additions, 0 transitions, 1,898 unchanged, assumptions: none — the pass changed no registry entry, only the log that records it, and the solver's counts, the extractor's and moat-prep arith's agree exactly at every stage, three instruments on one registry. The phextura shadow absorbed the pass natively (base sync clean; 16 inserts, 13 replaces, no removes — the replaces carrying both the filing's edits and the restructure's record at 1.1.5; the replayed state identical to the direct conversion on all 1,987 compared scrolls, the compared difference empty; 9 keys minted and one bibliography insert; NI from the transaction log equal to the canonical 7/827 exactly; validate.py GREEN against this pass's conversion report, named explicitly on the