# Journal 95 — Continuous Latent Diffusion Language Model — Guo et al.

Paper: Continuous Latent Diffusion Language Model — Hongcan Guo, Qinyu Zhao, Yian Zhao, Shen Nie, Rui Zhu, Qiushan Guo, Feng Wang, Tao Yang, Hengshuang Zhao, Guoqiang Wei and Yan Zeng
arXiv: 2605.06548
Absorbed: 2026-11-25

Entry 95 — Paper 102 — Continuous Latent Diffusion Language Model — Hongcan Guo, Qinyu Zhao, Yian Zhao, Shen Nie, Rui Zhu, Qiushan Guo, Feng Wang, Tao Yang, Hengshuang Zhao, Guoqiang Wei and Yan Zeng — a Will-posted ingestion, no queue rank: Will posted the arXiv PDF link in the MOAT chat on 2026-11-25, and under the standing channel rule a bare link from Will is an ingestion, so the leg ran in the pre-processed shape with no blind seal and the queue untouched. The text stands held entire from arXiv's HTML — version v1, the only version, submitted 7 May 2026, ninety-nine pages, thirty-one figures, nine tables by the record's own comments — fetched twice (abstract page and HTML), single-threaded, and reused for every leg. The work itself: a hierarchical latent diffusion language model, Cola DLM, in three parts — a causal Text VAE that learns a stable mapping between text and a continuous latent under reconstruction, a BERT-style masking loss and a KL term; a block-causal DiT that learns a flow prior over that latent, bidirectional inside a block and causal across blocks; and a conditional decoder that realizes text from sampled latents. Its founding distinction is the path's object: where autoregressive models expand a prefix, where LLaDA recovers a discretely corrupted text and Plaid a continuous token-aligned code, Cola's diffusion path transports a prior — carrying a base Gaussian to the learned distribution of a semantic latent — and text is drawn only afterwards, at the decoder. Around the construction the paper builds a theory in its own terms: an ELBO decomposition into reconstruction, mutual information and prior matching; a unified Markov-path view in which the four model families share one outer form and differ by where their path lives; a total statistical burden — family approximation error plus inference gap — under which the latent model beats its comparison exactly when its burden is smaller; and an applicability boundary of three curves, headed by a rate-distortion curve that must already be small at low rate. The experiments run four research questions at roughly two billion parameters against the authors' own matched AR and LLaDA retrainings: the optimal noise-schedule timeshift drifts with latent dimension, read as evidence of shared semantic structure; the latent space must evolve jointly with its prior from a stable start, neither frozen nor trained from scratch; block size sixteen with eight to ten denoising steps recovers most of the gain, a claimed 1.6–2.0× sequential-depth reduction; and a scaling study to about 2000 EFLOPs whose headline stands on its figure alone. Two smaller results carry their own weight: likelihood and generation quality come apart — perplexity tracks the probability space's smoothness, generation the semantic space's — and latent compression by patching fails not at compression but at odd-length prompt boundaries.

What the filing did to the book is to give cluster AV its fifth paper. The cluster call was weighed on the record from the construction itself: AV's arrangement — a sample formed from noise in a space learned for the purpose, each block decodable as it forms — is met term for term, and the one difference, the path's object, files inside the cluster as a concept rather than founding a country; AT was held apart (no state is recomputed at depth; block-causality is a factorization, not a recurrence) and AW likewise (a construction, not a survey). Thirteen concepts were filed, every one attributed: Cola DLM itself; latent prior transport, the founding distinction; the Text VAE; the block-causal latent prior; the unified Markov-path view; the ELBO decomposition; the total statistical burden; the three governing curves; the likelihood-generation gap; joint latent evolution; the optimal-timeshift drift; clean condition repaint; and latent compression with its boundary failure. No foundation was laid — flow matching already stands at 1.3.372, and the rate-distortion function files inside the governing-curves concept. No held concept was revised: 1.2.615 states LaDiR's denoising trajectory truly, and a prior transport files beside it, not over it; 1.2.612's latent thought space is a space learned for reasoning, which Cola's semantic prior space is not; 1.2.800 and 1.2.801 stand — the paper spends classifier-free guidance as an inference scale and files no construction of it; 1.2.663's continuous tokens are token-aligned by definition, and Cola's latents never are. Two stated state machines were drawn out of the work — the block-wise generation workflow of §3.2.3, PREFIX ENCODED to BLOCK TRANSPORTED to BLOCK DECODED to SEQUENCE CLOSED, its gap the first block's conditioning; and the probability-estimation procedure of Algorithms 1–2, LATENT DRAWN to DENSITY INTEGRATED to WEIGHTS AVERAGED to ESTIMATE READ, its gap that it prices exactly the quantity §5.1 demotes — carrying the